LICENSE SCOPE FOR VERSION 1.0.0
==============================

The following scopes assign different licenses to different parts of the
release. They are not a choice of either license for every file.

MIT license (see LICENSE-CODE.txt):
  - All Python source files, including the PDF build helper.
  - The JSON proof certificates in proof/.
  - .github/workflows/verify.yml and .gitignore.

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (see LICENSE-DOCUMENTATION.txt):
  - The manuscript PDF and manuscript TeX source.
  - The generated TeX classification and budget tables.
  - README, release notes, derivation notes, and review documentation.
  - Recorded verification outputs, citation metadata, release metadata,
    VERSION, and the SHA256SUMS.txt manifest.

The license texts themselves retain their original terms and notices.
References to third-party publications do not relicense those publications.

Research authors, in order:
  Ziyao Tang (唐梓耀), Ming Ding (丁铭), ChatGPT.

The named AI-system contribution is described in the manuscript and README.
Authorship credit here does not assert that an AI system is a copyright owner.
